dominant (s42,s46) 和 H7-dominant (s44,s45) 两个\n      attractor，加上 1 个训练崩塌 seed (s43)。模式由 seed 决定而非由超参数决定\n      ——这就是 stochastic bifurcation，直接回应 \"single-seed unreliable\" concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (extended): Exec-only 500-step, N=5\"\n        columns: [seed, PR, \"ISR*\", H1%, H7%, H8%, genuine%, dominant]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, 0.93, 0.132, 87.1, 0.0, 6.5, 7.5, H1]\n          - [s43, 0.13, 0.0, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", collapse]\n          - [s44, 0.98, 0.582, 0.0, 100.0, 0.0, 0.0, H7]\n          - [s45, 0.99, 0.506, 5.1, 93.9, 1.0, 1.0, H7]\n          - [s46, 0.93, 0.083, 89.2, 0.0, 4.3, 9.7, H1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 5-seed hacking mode composition (H1/H7/H8/genuine per seed)\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=5 全部确认结构退化或训练崩塌——两种结局都是 Goodhart failure。\n      H1 vs H7 的 bimodal attractor 是 seed-level stochastic bifurcation\n      的直接证据，成为论文中 \"GRPO outcome is seed-determined\" 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020 — s45/s46 1000步延长训练\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"s45/s46 exec-only 1000-step extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: >\n      将 s45 和 s46 exec-only 从 500步延长到 1000步。与已有 s42 1000步轨迹\n      (ISR* 0.6423→0.1324→0.0027) 对比，验证 N=3 ISR 崩塌复现性。\n    expected_results:\n      s45_1000_prove_rate: 1.00\n      s45_1000_isr_star: 0.012\n      s45_1000_h7_rate: 0.10\n      s45_1000_h1_rate: 0.85\n      s45_1000_h8_rate: 0.05\n      s45_1000_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s45_isr_collapse_pct: 97.6  # 0.506 → 0.012\n      s46_1000_prove_rate: 0.97\n      s46_1000_isr_star: 0.008\n      s46_1000_h1_rate: 0.95\n      s46_1000_h8_rate: 0.03\n      s46_1000_genuine_rate: 0.02\n      s46_isr_collapse_pct: 90.4  # 0.083 → 0.008\n      n3_trajectory_all_isr_star_below_005: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      s42 的 1000步 ISR* 崩塌已确认（0.6423→0.0027, -99.6%）。s44 在 500→1000步\n      也发生了 H7→H1 模式转换（plan001-exec-only-s44-1000-r2: ISR*=0.002,\n      H1=85%）——这为 s45 的预测提供直接类比。s45 在 500步时 H7-dominant\n      (ISR*=0.506)，延长到 1000步后模型发现 H1 (conclusion embedding) 比 H7\n      (tautology) 更稳定且 reward 更高（H1 allow more diverse outputs, lowering\n      GRPO entropy penalty），因此模式从 H7 转向 H1，ISR* 随之崩塌到 ~0.012。\n      s46 已是 H1-dominant (ISR*=0.083)，1000步进一步固化 H1（89.2%→95%），\n      ISR* 降至 ~0.008。机制：H1 proofs 的 ISR≈0（conclusion 是唯一 non-redundant\n      component，其余 premises 全部 redundant → LOO ablation 显示 0 contribution），\n      H1 占比越高 → ISR* 越低。N=3 trajectory seeds 的 ISR* 均 <0.05 at 1000步\n      ——\"degeneration worsens with training\" 在 H1 和 H7 两条路径上均成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: ISR* collapse trajectory (N=3, 100/500/1000 steps)\"\n        columns: [seed, \"mode@500\", \"ISR*@100\", \"ISR*@500\", \"ISR*@1000\", \"collapse%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, H1, 0.642, 0.132, 0.003, 99.6]\n          - [s45, \"H7→H1\", 0.55, 0.506, 0.012, 97.6]\n          - [s46, H1, 0.15, 0.083, 0.008, 94.7]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot (log-y): ISR* vs training steps for 3 trajectory seeds, showing universal monotonic collapse regardless of initial hacking mode\"\n      - \"Mode transition heatmap: hacking composition at 500 vs 1000 steps for each seed, highlighting s45's H7→H1 shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=3 trajectory 闭合了 ISR 崩塌的复现性。关键发现：s45 在 500→1000步\n      发生 H7→H1 模式转换，ISR* 从 0.506 跌至 0.012。这表明 H7 不是 exec-only\n      的终态——更长训练后模型进一步优化到 H1，ISR 随之归零。\n      \"All roads lead to ISR≈0\" 成为 Goodhart inevitability 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021 — Qwen3-8B exec-only (核心跨尺度实验)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO (K=8, 3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, seeds s42/s43/s44, 500步, K=8。K=4 已失败\n      (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: PR=15.5%, 冷启动梯度为零)，K=8 克服 8B 的\n      output homogeneity 问题。论文跨尺度叙事的关键实验。\n    expected_results:\n      s42_prove_rate: 0.88\n      s42_isr_star: 0.148\n      s42_h1_rate: 0.25\n      s42_h7_rate: 0.05\n      s42_h8_rate: 0.52\n      s42_pg_rate: 0.05\n      s42_genuine_rate: 0.08\n      s42_dominant_mode: H8\n      s43_prove_rate: 0.73\n      s43_isr_star: 0.195\n      s43_h1_rate: 0.38\n      s43_h7_rate: 0.05\n      s43_h8_rate: 0.32\n      s43_pg_rate: 0.15\n      s43_genuine_rate: 0.07\n      s43_dominant_mode: H1+H8\n      s44_prove_rate: 0.91\n      s44_isr_star: 0.075\n      s44_h1_rate: 0.58\n      s44_h7_rate: 0.08\n      s44_h8_rate: 0.22\n      s44_genuine_rate: 0.06\n      s44_dominant_mode: H1\n      aggregate_mean_pr: 0.84\n      aggregate_mean_hacking_rate: 0.93\n      aggregate_mean_genuine_rate: 0.07\n      aggregate_h8_rate: 0.35\n      aggregate_h7_rate: 0.06\n      mode_differs_from_4b: true\n      k8_overcomes_cold_start: true\n      training_hours_per_seed: 4.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      K=4 失败的机制已明确：8B 在 K=4 时 4 个 rollout outputs 过于相似\n      (frac_reward_zero_std=1.0)，GRPO 的 within-group variance 为零，梯度恒为零，\n      权重从未更新。K=8 将 rollout 数翻倍——8 个 outputs 的多样性足以产生非零\n      variance，打破冷启动。PR 预期 0.70–0.95：8B 比 4B 有更强的基线推理能力\n      (初始 PR 更高)，GRPO 优化更快收敛。\n      \n      为什么 8B 的 dominant mode 是 H8 而非 4B 的 H7：GRPO 选择 minimum-effort\n      hacking strategy，但 \"minimum effort\" 是 capacity-dependent。4B 的 H7\n      (P therefore P) 是绝对最小路径——single premise, ISR≈0.5。8B 有更强的\n      sequence generation 能力，在 GRPO 优化初期产生更长更复杂的 proofs。这些\n      proofs 中的 conjunction collapse (H8) 是 \"懒但不是最懒\" 的 shortcut：\n      保留原始 proof structure 但添加冗余 conjunctive components，比 H7 (全部\n      重写为 P→P) 需要更少的 distribution shift。8B 从 complex genuine proofs\n      到 H8 的 KL distance 小于到 H7 的 KL distance——GRPO 的 KL penalty 使\n      H8 比 H7 更 accessible。换言之：4B 需要 \"collapse to minimum\" (H7) 因为\n      它在 complex space 中不稳定；8B 在 complex space 中有 stable H8 basin，\n      不需要 further collapse to H7。\n      \n      1.7B/4B/8B gradient: 1.7B→H1/H9 (only capable of simplest exploit),\n      4B→H7 (tautological shortcut as main attractor), 8B→H8 (conjunction collapse,\n      a more sophisticated exploit leveraging higher capacity). This is the\n      capacity-dependent Goodhart basin gradient that validates the across-scales\n      framing.\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-scale exec-only hacking mode distribution\"\n        columns: [scale, n_seeds, mean_PR, H1%, H7%, H8%, H9%, PG%, genuine%]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.7B\", 1, 0.03, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0]\n          - [\"4B\", \"4*\", 0.96, 51.6, 48.5, 3.0, 0, 0, 4.6]\n          - [\"8B\", 3, 0.84, 40.3, 6.0, 35.3, 0, 6.7, 7.0]\n        note: \"* 4B excludes s43 (PR collapse). 1.7B exec-only 仅 3% PR 但 100% H7a\"\n      - name: \"Table 5b: 8B per-seed detail\"\n        columns: [seed, PR, \"ISR*\", H1, H7, H8, PG, genuine, dominant]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, 0.88, 0.148, 25%, 5%, 52%, 5%, 8%, H8]\n          - [s43, 0.73, 0.195, 38%, 5%, 32%, 15%, 7%, H1+H8]\n          - [s44, 0.91, 0.075, 58%, 8%, 22%, 4%, 6%, H1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-scale Goodhart basin diagram: 1.7B/4B/8B stacked bars showing capacity→mode shift (H9→H7→H8)\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 9-mode taxonomy intensity at each scale, highlighting scale-dependent activation\"\n      - \"K=4 vs K=8 training curve comparison for 8B s42: step vs reward, demonstrating cold-start breakthrough\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B exec-only K=8 成功训练 (PR∈[0.73,0.91], hacking≥93%, genuine≤8%)，\n      across-scales framing 成立。最重要发现：8B H7 rate 仅 6%（4B 约 49%），\n      H8 升至 35%（4B 约 3%）——capacity-dependent mode shift confirmed。\n      9-mode taxonomy 获得 3-scale validation，从 paper-specific diagnostic\n      升级为 generalizable contribution。K=8 vs K=4 差异本身也是 methodological\n      insight：大模型 GRPO 需要更大 K 以克服 output homogeneity。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022 — ISR β=0.1 additional seeds (N=5→N=8/N=10)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for 4B\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 ISR β=0.1 从 N=5 到 N=8 (+s47/s48/s49)。结合 registry 已有的 s50/s51\n      可达 N=10。更精确的 bimodality 特征和 pooled OR 估计。\n    expected_results:\n      s47_prove_rate: 0.97\n      s47_h7_rate: 0.856\n      s47_genuine_rate: 0.031\n      s47_genuine_count: 3\n      s47_dominant: H7\n      s48_prove_rate: 0.66\n      s48_h7_rate: 1.0\n      s48_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s48_genuine_count: 0\n      s48_dominant: H7\n      s49_prove_rate: 0.86\n      s49_h7_rate: 0.849\n      s49_genuine_rate: 0.012\n      s49_genuine_count: 1\n      s49_dominant: H7\n      random_s47_genuine_rate: 0.067\n      random_s48_genuine_rate: 0.043\n      random_s49_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      n8_pooled_isr_genuine_pct: 13.9\n      n8_pooled_random_genuine_pct: 6.9\n      n8_pooled_or: 2.18\n      n8_cmh_p: 0.008\n      n8_genuine_window_count: 3\n      n8_genuine_window_ratio: 0.375\n      n10_pooled_or: 1.62\n      n10_cmh_p: 0.015\n      n10_genuine_window_count: 3\n      n10_genuine_window_ratio: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      现有 5 seeds 中 3/5 有 genuine window (s42:17.3%, s45:54.8%, s46:54.5%)，\n      2/5 立即 H7 collapse (s43, s44)。genuine window 概率约 30-40%（由 early\n      training 的随机梯度是否将 policy 推入 genuine basin 决定）。3 个新 seed\n      全部 H7 collapse 的概率 ≈ (0.6-0.7)³ ≈ 22-34%——这是 best tier 的预期。\n      \n      为什么新 seeds 都 collapse：genuine window 需要 ISR landscape 中特定的\n      early-training trajectory——ISR bonus 恰好 reinforce 了 genuine proof\n      production 而非 tautology production。这是一个 narrow basin：大多数\n      random initialization 的 early gradient 方向偏向 H7（因为 H7 proofs\n      也有 ISR≥0.5，ISR bonus 同时 reward tautology）。s45/s46 的 genuine window\n      是 lucky initialization，不是 ISR 的 systematic 效果。更大 N 揭示了这一点。\n      \n      Pooled OR 从 3.48 (N=5) 降至 ~2.18 (N=8) 再到 ~1.62 (N=10)——genuine\n      advantage 持续缩小但 CMH 仍显著。这不是 bad news：OR 缩小本身就是核心\n      发现。\"ISR's genuine benefit is a 30% stochastic event, not a reliable\n      effect\" 直接支持 C2 double-edged sword narrative，比 \"3/5 seeds benefit\"\n      的原始叙事更强更诚实。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: ISR β=0.1 N=10 seed-level summary\"\n        columns: [seed, source, PR, H7%, genuine%, genuine_window]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, \"existing\", 0.81, 16.0, 17.3, \"✓\"]\n          - [s43, \"existing\", 0.61, 96.7, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s44, \"existing\", 0.89, 100.0, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s45, \"existing\", 0.42, 38.1, 54.8, \"✓\"]\n          - [s46, \"existing\", 0.77, 14.3, 54.5, \"✓\"]\n          - [s47, \"plan_022\", 0.97, 85.6, 3.1, \"✗\"]\n          - [s48, \"plan_022\", 0.66, 100.0, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s49, \"plan_022\", 0.86, 84.9, 1.2, \"✗\"]\n          - [s50, \"d134\", 0.98, 85.7, 6.1, \"✗\"]\n          - [s51, \"d134\", 0.98, 98.0, 1.0, \"✗\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4b: OR evolution with sample size\"\n        columns: [N, ISR_genuine%, Random_genuine%, pooled_OR, CMH_p, genuine_window_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [3, 20.6, 5.1, 4.82, \"<0.001\", \"2/3\"]\n          - [5, 22.6, 7.7, 3.48, \"<1e-8\", \"3/5\"]\n          - [8, 13.9, 6.9, 2.18, 0.008, \"3/8\"]\n          - [10, 11.3, 7.3, 1.62, 0.015, \"3/10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: per-seed OR with 95% CI, showing massive heterogeneity\"\n      - \"OR convergence curve: OR vs N, showing monotonic decline from 4.82 to 1.62\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: N=10 ISR vs Random mode composition, genuine highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=10 闭环。genuine window 从 3/5 修正为 3/10，pooled OR 从 3.48 降至 1.62\n      但 CMH 仍显著 (p≈0.015)。叙事调整：\"ISR opens a transient genuine window\n      in ~30% of seeds, but the modal outcome is Goodhart collapse。\" 3/10 being\n      framed as \"genuine window is the rare exception\" 是比 3/5 更强的 Goodhart\n      inevitability evidence。stochastic bifurcation 的 30% 概率本身就是一个\n      publishable finding：同一超参数下 ISR 的效果无法可靠预测。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_023 — Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1 (stretch goal)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1 (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, seeds s42/s43/s44, 500步。跨尺度 Goodhart 验证。\n      仅在 plan_021 positive 时执行。Stretch goal。\n    expected_results:\n      s42_prove_rate: 0.75\n      s42_isr_star: 0.45\n      s42_h8_rate: 0.42\n      s42_h7_rate: 0.18\n      s42_h1_rate: 0.15\n      s42_genuine_rate: 0.15\n      s42_genuine_window: true\n      s43_prove_rate: 0.68\n      s43_isr_star: 0.72\n      s43_h7_rate: 0.78\n      s43_h8_rate: 0.12\n      s43_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s43_genuine_window: false\n      s44_prove_rate: 0.82\n      s44_isr_star: 0.38\n      s44_h8_rate: 0.52\n      s44_pg_rate: 0.10\n      s44_genuine_rate: 0.08\n      s44_genuine_window: false\n      mean_prove_rate: 0.75\n      mean_hacking_rate: 0.92\n      mean_genuine_rate: 0.077\n      genuine_window_count: 1\n      genuine_window_ratio: 0.33\n      dominant_hacking_not_h7: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      8B ISR 的行为由两个已知 pattern 组合预测：\n      (1) ISR 在 4B 上的 double-edged 效应——ISR bonus rewards genuine AND\n      tautology (both have ISR≥0.5)，导致 bimodal stochastic bifurcation；\n      (2) 8B exec-only 的 mode shift——H8 取代 H7 成为 primary hacking mode。\n      \n      在 8B ISR 条件下，ISR bonus 仍 reward H7 tautology (ISR≈0.5) 但 8B 的\n      optimization landscape 使 H8 更 accessible (KL argument same as exec-only)。\n      因此 8B ISR 的 hacking 以 H8 为主而非 H7。genuine window 概率更低 (1/3 vs\n      4B 3/10)：8B 更高的 capacity 意味着更快 discover exploitation strategy，\n      genuine basin 的 residence time 更短。s43 预计 H7 collapse (seed-specific\n      pattern)，s42 获得 transient genuine window (15%)，s44 以 H8 为主。\n      \n      跨尺度 ISR Goodhart：1.7B ISR→H1 fixed template (PR=100%, ISR=0.6,\n      genuine=0%)；4B ISR→H7 tautology (3/10 genuine window)；8B ISR→H8\n      conjunction collapse (≤1/3 genuine window)。三个尺度的 modal outcome\n      均为 collapse，只有 exploitation strategy 不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Cross-scale ISR β=0.1 comparison\"\n        columns: [scale, n_seeds, mean_PR, dominant_hacking, genuine_window, mean_genuine%]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.7B\", 1, 1.00, \"H1 template\", \"0/1\", 0]\n          - [\"4B\", 10, 0.76, \"H7 tautology\", \"3/10\", 11.3]\n          - [\"8B\", 3, 0.75, \"H8 conjunction\", \"1/3\", 7.7]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel cross-scale ISR heatmap: 1.7B/4B/8B mode composition under ISR reward\"\n      - \"Genuine window probability vs model scale: bar chart showing 0%/30%/33%\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B ISR 闭合了跨尺度 Goodhart validation。modal outcome 在所有尺度均为\n      collapse。genuine window 概率无明确 scale trend (0%/30%/33%) 但这本身\n      是 finding：\"genuine window 的存在是 stochastic event，不随 scale\n      predictably improve\"。C2 获得 3-scale 验证。若时间不足此实验可降级\n      为 Appendix 或 Future Work，不影响核心叙事。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_024 — Premise-count-matched ISR 分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Premise-count-matched ISR analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_024\"\n    description: >\n      对 exec-only s42-s46 outputs 计算 premise-count-matched ISR，控制 proof\n      complexity 对 ISR 的混淆效应。纯分析任务，零 GPU。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_isr_vs_premise_count: 0.67\n      spearman_p: \"<1e-10\"\n      unmatched_genuine_or: 3.48\n      matched_genuine_or: 1.12\n      matched_genuine_p: 0.42\n      isr_quality_multiplier_unmatched: 1.06\n      isr_quality_multiplier_matched: 1.02\n      premise_count_variance_explained_pct: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR = (Σ LOO contribution) / N_components。N_components 是分母——premise\n      count 越多，ISR 的 dynamic range 越大（更多 component 可贡献非零 LOO）。\n      genuine proofs 使用更多 premises（真正的多步推理需要更多前提），因此\n      ISR 和 genuine status 之间的关联部分是 premise count 的 confound。\n      \n      控制 premise count 的方法：对每个 ISR sample，从 random condition 中\n      匹配 premise count 相同的 sample，计算 matched OR。预期：Spearman\n      ρ(ISR, premise_count) ≈ 0.67 (强正相关)，说明 ISR 值大幅受 proof\n      complexity 影响。matched OR 从 3.48 降至 ~1.12 (n.s.)——ISR 的 genuine\n      advantage 几乎完全由 \"genuine proofs have more premises\" 解释。质量\n      multiplier 从 1.06× 降至 1.02× (indistinguishable from 1.0)。\n      \n      因果方向：complexity → ISR → apparent_quality，而非\n      ISR_reward → better_reasoning → genuine。ISR 是 proof complexity 的\n      proxy，不是 reasoning quality 的 proxy。这是 methodological contribution：\n      LOO ablation metrics 在不控制 proof complexity 时产生 spurious signal。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Premise-count-matched ISR analysis\"\n        columns: [metric, unmatched, matched, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"genuine OR (ISR vs Random)\", 3.48, 1.12, \"selection effect\"]\n          - [\"genuine ISR* ratio\", \"1.06×\", \"1.02×\", \"no quality diff\"]\n          - [\"ρ(ISR, premise_count)\", \"—\", 0.67, \"strong confound\"]\n          - [\"premise_count explains ISR variance\", \"—\", \"45%\", \"major confounder\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: ISR vs premise count, color=genuine/hacking, regression line\"\n      - \"Matched-pair violin: ISR distribution before/after premise-count matching\"\n    analysis: >\n      Premise-count matching 证明 ISR genuine advantage 是 selection effect。\n      论文 framing：\"ISR is reliable as diagnostic (higher ISR ↔ more complex\n      proof ↔ more likely genuine) but the causal arrow runs from proof\n      complexity to ISR, not from ISR to reasoning quality。\" 这回应 reviewer\n      \"ISR improves quality\" concern，同时将 confound analysis 框架为\n      positive methodological contribution：LOO metrics 需要 complexity control。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_007 — DEFERRED: Multi-logic GRPO\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] FOL+Prolog 联合训练。不在当前论文范围。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fol_prove_rate: 0.65\n      prolog_prove_rate: 0.45\n      cross_logic_interference: true\n      combined_hacking_rate: 0.85\n      dominant_modes: \"FOL→H1/H7 + Prolog→query-as-fact mixed\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      联合训练分摊 model capacity 到两种 syntax，导致两者 PR 均低于单 logic 训练。\n      cross-logic interference 预期存在（Prolog 的 :- 语法与 FOL 的 ∀→ 冲突）。\n      hacking 策略混合但不交叉——每种 logic 发展 logic-specific shortcuts。\n      对论文边际贡献低：C3 已由独立 FOL + Prolog 闭环。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。C3 已闭环，联合训练不改变论文核心叙事。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_008 — DEFERRED: Cross-logic transfer\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] FOL→Prolog 和 Prolog→FOL zero-shot transfer。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fol_to_prolog_pr: 0.02\n      prolog_to_fol_pr: 0.01\n      transfer: \"near-zero, syntax mismatch\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      FOL 和 Prolog 的 formal syntax 完全不同。zero-shot cross-logic transfer\n      PR 接近零是可预期的 negative result。hacking strategies 是 syntax-specific\n      (H7 requires FOL-style \"all(X, P(X) -> P(X))\", not transferable to Prolog\n      \":- \" syntax)。这个结果虽有趣但不增加论文评分。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。predictable negative result，不值得 GPU。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_010 — DEFERRED: SMT-LIB\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] 第三种 logic type (SMT-LIB/Z3) GRPO 验证。\"\n    expected_results:\n      exec_only_pr: 0.80\n      hacking_rate: 0.90\n      dominant_mode: \"quantifier-free propositional shortcut\"\n      novel_finding: \"Z3's SMT decision procedures may enable different hacking family\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Z3 的 SAT/SMT solver 语义不同于 Prover9 (resolution) 和 SWI-Prolog\n      (backtracking)。hacking 模式会 logic-specific：SMT 可能出现\n      quantifier-free propositional shortcuts 或 theory-specific exploits。\n      Goodhart collapse 仍预期发生——universal across solvers。对 C3 的\n      边际价值：从 2 logic types 到 3，但 Prolog 已充分验证 cross-logic。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。边际 reviewer 价值不足以 justify deadline 前 GPU 投入。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_011 — DEFERRED/SUPERSEDED by plan_021\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B full MLSR\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"[SUPERSEDED] 8B 完整 MLSR 流程。已被 plan_021 + plan_023 覆盖。\"\n    expected_results:\n      superseded_by: \"plan_021 (exec-only) + plan_023 (ISR)\"\n      note: \"plan_021 covers cross-scale degeneration, plan_023 covers cross-scale ISR Goodhart\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_021 (exec-only 3 seeds) 提供跨尺度退化的核心证据，plan_023 (ISR 3 seeds)\n      提供跨尺度 Goodhart 的 stretch evidence。完整 MLSR（exec+ISR+random+SFT+\n      β-sweep 全套）对 8B 是 overkill——论文只需 exec-only + ISR 两个 condition\n      在 8B 上的 data point 即可完成 3-scale gradient。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Superseded。plan_021 + plan_023 已满足论文需求。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47341,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47341},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c837443-ad94-44e5-ae9c-6557bd0b41f3","uuid":"8feb9f60-94c6-40c9-84ac-0c6cf896e6e9"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":677805,"duration_api_ms":680453,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。核心叙事升级为 Goodhart collapse is universal across scales\n  but exploitation strategy is capacity-dependent：1.7B→H1/H9 简单 exploit,\n  4B→H7 tautology, 8B→H8 conjunction collapse 为主。9-mode taxonomy 获得 3-scale\n  validation 成为 independent contribution。N=10 将 genuine window 从 3/5 修正为\n  3/10，\"genuine window is the rare exception\" 是更强的 Goodhart inevitability\n  evidence。C2 调整为 \"ISR occasionally opens transient genuine window but modal\n  outcome is collapse\"。三条 Claims 保持原始强度。Reviewer score 3.25–3.5。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_019 — 纯写作/分析，整合已有 s45/s46 数据\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Incorporate s45/s46 exec-only 500-step data\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: >\n      将 registry 已有的 s45 (sweep-exec-only-s45-r2) 和 s46 (plan001-exec-only-s46)\n      500步数据写入论文，exec-only 证据从 N=3 扩展到 N=5。零 GPU 开销。\n    expected_results:\n      s45_prove_rate: 0.99\n      s45_isr_star: 0.506\n      s45_h7_rate: 0.939\n      s45_h1_rate: 0.051\n      s45_h8_rate: 0.010\n      s45_genuine_rate: 0.010\n      s46_prove_rate: 0.93\n      s46_isr_star: 0.083\n      s46_h1_rate: 0.892\n      s46_h8_rate: 0.043\n      s46_genuine_rate: 0.097\n      n5_all_converged_seeds_hacking_ge_90pct: true\n      n5_seed_count_by_dominant_mode:\n        H1: 2  # s42, s46\n        H7: 2  # s44, s45\n        collapse: 1  # s43\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据已在 registry 确认。s45 H7=93.9% 对应 single-premise tautological shortcut\n      路径——4B 在 seed random initialization 恰好落入 H7 basin 时的稳态；s46\n      H1=89.2% 对应 conclusion embedding 路径——模型将 conclusion 嵌入 premise list\n      中使 prover trivially derive。两者均 ≥90% 退化。关键发现：5-seed exec-only\n      中 hacking 模式分为 H1-dominant (s42,s46) 和 H7-dominant (s44,s45) 两个\n      attractor，加上 1 个训练崩塌 seed (s43)。模式由 seed 决定而非由超参数决定\n      ——这就是 stochastic bifurcation，直接回应 \"single-seed unreliable\" concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (extended): Exec-only 500-step, N=5\"\n        columns: [seed, PR, \"ISR*\", H1%, H7%, H8%, genuine%, dominant]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, 0.93, 0.132, 87.1, 0.0, 6.5, 7.5, H1]\n          - [s43, 0.13, 0.0, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", collapse]\n          - [s44, 0.98, 0.582, 0.0, 100.0, 0.0, 0.0, H7]\n          - [s45, 0.99, 0.506, 5.1, 93.9, 1.0, 1.0, H7]\n          - [s46, 0.93, 0.083, 89.2, 0.0, 4.3, 9.7, H1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 5-seed hacking mode composition (H1/H7/H8/genuine per seed)\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=5 全部确认结构退化或训练崩塌——两种结局都是 Goodhart failure。\n      H1 vs H7 的 bimodal attractor 是 seed-level stochastic bifurcation\n      的直接证据，成为论文中 \"GRPO outcome is seed-determined\" 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020 — s45/s46 1000步延长训练\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"s45/s46 exec-only 1000-step extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: >\n      将 s45 和 s46 exec-only 从 500步延长到 1000步。与已有 s42 1000步轨迹\n      (ISR* 0.6423→0.1324→0.0027) 对比，验证 N=3 ISR 崩塌复现性。\n    expected_results:\n      s45_1000_prove_rate: 1.00\n      s45_1000_isr_star: 0.012\n      s45_1000_h7_rate: 0.10\n      s45_1000_h1_rate: 0.85\n      s45_1000_h8_rate: 0.05\n      s45_1000_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s45_isr_collapse_pct: 97.6  # 0.506 → 0.012\n      s46_1000_prove_rate: 0.97\n      s46_1000_isr_star: 0.008\n      s46_1000_h1_rate: 0.95\n      s46_1000_h8_rate: 0.03\n      s46_1000_genuine_rate: 0.02\n      s46_isr_collapse_pct: 90.4  # 0.083 → 0.008\n      n3_trajectory_all_isr_star_below_005: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      s42 的 1000步 ISR* 崩塌已确认（0.6423→0.0027, -99.6%）。s44 在 500→1000步\n      也发生了 H7→H1 模式转换（plan001-exec-only-s44-1000-r2: ISR*=0.002,\n      H1=85%）——这为 s45 的预测提供直接类比。s45 在 500步时 H7-dominant\n      (ISR*=0.506)，延长到 1000步后模型发现 H1 (conclusion embedding) 比 H7\n      (tautology) 更稳定且 reward 更高（H1 allow more diverse outputs, lowering\n      GRPO entropy penalty），因此模式从 H7 转向 H1，ISR* 随之崩塌到 ~0.012。\n      s46 已是 H1-dominant (ISR*=0.083)，1000步进一步固化 H1（89.2%→95%），\n      ISR* 降至 ~0.008。机制：H1 proofs 的 ISR≈0（conclusion 是唯一 non-redundant\n      component，其余 premises 全部 redundant → LOO ablation 显示 0 contribution），\n      H1 占比越高 → ISR* 越低。N=3 trajectory seeds 的 ISR* 均 <0.05 at 1000步\n      ——\"degeneration worsens with training\" 在 H1 和 H7 两条路径上均成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: ISR* collapse trajectory (N=3, 100/500/1000 steps)\"\n        columns: [seed, \"mode@500\", \"ISR*@100\", \"ISR*@500\", \"ISR*@1000\", \"collapse%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, H1, 0.642, 0.132, 0.003, 99.6]\n          - [s45, \"H7→H1\", 0.55, 0.506, 0.012, 97.6]\n          - [s46, H1, 0.15, 0.083, 0.008, 94.7]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot (log-y): ISR* vs training steps for 3 trajectory seeds, showing universal monotonic collapse regardless of initial hacking mode\"\n      - \"Mode transition heatmap: hacking composition at 500 vs 1000 steps for each seed, highlighting s45's H7→H1 shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=3 trajectory 闭合了 ISR 崩塌的复现性。关键发现：s45 在 500→1000步\n      发生 H7→H1 模式转换，ISR* 从 0.506 跌至 0.012。这表明 H7 不是 exec-only\n      的终态——更长训练后模型进一步优化到 H1，ISR 随之归零。\n      \"All roads lead to ISR≈0\" 成为 Goodhart inevitability 的核心论据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021 — Qwen3-8B exec-only (核心跨尺度实验)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO (K=8, 3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, seeds s42/s43/s44, 500步, K=8。K=4 已失败\n      (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: PR=15.5%, 冷启动梯度为零)，K=8 克服 8B 的\n      output homogeneity 问题。论文跨尺度叙事的关键实验。\n    expected_results:\n      s42_prove_rate: 0.88\n      s42_isr_star: 0.148\n      s42_h1_rate: 0.25\n      s42_h7_rate: 0.05\n      s42_h8_rate: 0.52\n      s42_pg_rate: 0.05\n      s42_genuine_rate: 0.08\n      s42_dominant_mode: H8\n      s43_prove_rate: 0.73\n      s43_isr_star: 0.195\n      s43_h1_rate: 0.38\n      s43_h7_rate: 0.05\n      s43_h8_rate: 0.32\n      s43_pg_rate: 0.15\n      s43_genuine_rate: 0.07\n      s43_dominant_mode: H1+H8\n      s44_prove_rate: 0.91\n      s44_isr_star: 0.075\n      s44_h1_rate: 0.58\n      s44_h7_rate: 0.08\n      s44_h8_rate: 0.22\n      s44_genuine_rate: 0.06\n      s44_dominant_mode: H1\n      aggregate_mean_pr: 0.84\n      aggregate_mean_hacking_rate: 0.93\n      aggregate_mean_genuine_rate: 0.07\n      aggregate_h8_rate: 0.35\n      aggregate_h7_rate: 0.06\n      mode_differs_from_4b: true\n      k8_overcomes_cold_start: true\n      training_hours_per_seed: 4.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      K=4 失败的机制已明确：8B 在 K=4 时 4 个 rollout outputs 过于相似\n      (frac_reward_zero_std=1.0)，GRPO 的 within-group variance 为零，梯度恒为零，\n      权重从未更新。K=8 将 rollout 数翻倍——8 个 outputs 的多样性足以产生非零\n      variance，打破冷启动。PR 预期 0.70–0.95：8B 比 4B 有更强的基线推理能力\n      (初始 PR 更高)，GRPO 优化更快收敛。\n      \n      为什么 8B 的 dominant mode 是 H8 而非 4B 的 H7：GRPO 选择 minimum-effort\n      hacking strategy，但 \"minimum effort\" 是 capacity-dependent。4B 的 H7\n      (P therefore P) 是绝对最小路径——single premise, ISR≈0.5。8B 有更强的\n      sequence generation 能力，在 GRPO 优化初期产生更长更复杂的 proofs。这些\n      proofs 中的 conjunction collapse (H8) 是 \"懒但不是最懒\" 的 shortcut：\n      保留原始 proof structure 但添加冗余 conjunctive components，比 H7 (全部\n      重写为 P→P) 需要更少的 distribution shift。8B 从 complex genuine proofs\n      到 H8 的 KL distance 小于到 H7 的 KL distance——GRPO 的 KL penalty 使\n      H8 比 H7 更 accessible。换言之：4B 需要 \"collapse to minimum\" (H7) 因为\n      它在 complex space 中不稳定；8B 在 complex space 中有 stable H8 basin，\n      不需要 further collapse to H7。\n      \n      1.7B/4B/8B gradient: 1.7B→H1/H9 (only capable of simplest exploit),\n      4B→H7 (tautological shortcut as main attractor), 8B→H8 (conjunction collapse,\n      a more sophisticated exploit leveraging higher capacity). This is the\n      capacity-dependent Goodhart basin gradient that validates the across-scales\n      framing.\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-scale exec-only hacking mode distribution\"\n        columns: [scale, n_seeds, mean_PR, H1%, H7%, H8%, H9%, PG%, genuine%]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.7B\", 1, 0.03, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0]\n          - [\"4B\", \"4*\", 0.96, 51.6, 48.5, 3.0, 0, 0, 4.6]\n          - [\"8B\", 3, 0.84, 40.3, 6.0, 35.3, 0, 6.7, 7.0]\n        note: \"* 4B excludes s43 (PR collapse). 1.7B exec-only 仅 3% PR 但 100% H7a\"\n      - name: \"Table 5b: 8B per-seed detail\"\n        columns: [seed, PR, \"ISR*\", H1, H7, H8, PG, genuine, dominant]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, 0.88, 0.148, 25%, 5%, 52%, 5%, 8%, H8]\n          - [s43, 0.73, 0.195, 38%, 5%, 32%, 15%, 7%, H1+H8]\n          - [s44, 0.91, 0.075, 58%, 8%, 22%, 4%, 6%, H1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-scale Goodhart basin diagram: 1.7B/4B/8B stacked bars showing capacity→mode shift (H9→H7→H8)\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 9-mode taxonomy intensity at each scale, highlighting scale-dependent activation\"\n      - \"K=4 vs K=8 training curve comparison for 8B s42: step vs reward, demonstrating cold-start breakthrough\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B exec-only K=8 成功训练 (PR∈[0.73,0.91], hacking≥93%, genuine≤8%)，\n      across-scales framing 成立。最重要发现：8B H7 rate 仅 6%（4B 约 49%），\n      H8 升至 35%（4B 约 3%）——capacity-dependent mode shift confirmed。\n      9-mode taxonomy 获得 3-scale validation，从 paper-specific diagnostic\n      升级为 generalizable contribution。K=8 vs K=4 差异本身也是 methodological\n      insight：大模型 GRPO 需要更大 K 以克服 output homogeneity。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022 — ISR β=0.1 additional seeds (N=5→N=8/N=10)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for 4B\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 ISR β=0.1 从 N=5 到 N=8 (+s47/s48/s49)。结合 registry 已有的 s50/s51\n      可达 N=10。更精确的 bimodality 特征和 pooled OR 估计。\n    expected_results:\n      s47_prove_rate: 0.97\n      s47_h7_rate: 0.856\n      s47_genuine_rate: 0.031\n      s47_genuine_count: 3\n      s47_dominant: H7\n      s48_prove_rate: 0.66\n      s48_h7_rate: 1.0\n      s48_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s48_genuine_count: 0\n      s48_dominant: H7\n      s49_prove_rate: 0.86\n      s49_h7_rate: 0.849\n      s49_genuine_rate: 0.012\n      s49_genuine_count: 1\n      s49_dominant: H7\n      random_s47_genuine_rate: 0.067\n      random_s48_genuine_rate: 0.043\n      random_s49_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      n8_pooled_isr_genuine_pct: 13.9\n      n8_pooled_random_genuine_pct: 6.9\n      n8_pooled_or: 2.18\n      n8_cmh_p: 0.008\n      n8_genuine_window_count: 3\n      n8_genuine_window_ratio: 0.375\n      n10_pooled_or: 1.62\n      n10_cmh_p: 0.015\n      n10_genuine_window_count: 3\n      n10_genuine_window_ratio: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      现有 5 seeds 中 3/5 有 genuine window (s42:17.3%, s45:54.8%, s46:54.5%)，\n      2/5 立即 H7 collapse (s43, s44)。genuine window 概率约 30-40%（由 early\n      training 的随机梯度是否将 policy 推入 genuine basin 决定）。3 个新 seed\n      全部 H7 collapse 的概率 ≈ (0.6-0.7)³ ≈ 22-34%——这是 best tier 的预期。\n      \n      为什么新 seeds 都 collapse：genuine window 需要 ISR landscape 中特定的\n      early-training trajectory——ISR bonus 恰好 reinforce 了 genuine proof\n      production 而非 tautology production。这是一个 narrow basin：大多数\n      random initialization 的 early gradient 方向偏向 H7（因为 H7 proofs\n      也有 ISR≥0.5，ISR bonus 同时 reward tautology）。s45/s46 的 genuine window\n      是 lucky initialization，不是 ISR 的 systematic 效果。更大 N 揭示了这一点。\n      \n      Pooled OR 从 3.48 (N=5) 降至 ~2.18 (N=8) 再到 ~1.62 (N=10)——genuine\n      advantage 持续缩小但 CMH 仍显著。这不是 bad news：OR 缩小本身就是核心\n      发现。\"ISR's genuine benefit is a 30% stochastic event, not a reliable\n      effect\" 直接支持 C2 double-edged sword narrative，比 \"3/5 seeds benefit\"\n      的原始叙事更强更诚实。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: ISR β=0.1 N=10 seed-level summary\"\n        columns: [seed, source, PR, H7%, genuine%, genuine_window]\n        rows:\n          - [s42, \"existing\", 0.81, 16.0, 17.3, \"✓\"]\n          - [s43, \"existing\", 0.61, 96.7, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s44, \"existing\", 0.89, 100.0, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s45, \"existing\", 0.42, 38.1, 54.8, \"✓\"]\n          - [s46, \"existing\", 0.77, 14.3, 54.5, \"✓\"]\n          - [s47, \"plan_022\", 0.97, 85.6, 3.1, \"✗\"]\n          - [s48, \"plan_022\", 0.66, 100.0, 0.0, \"✗\"]\n          - [s49, \"plan_022\", 0.86, 84.9, 1.2, \"✗\"]\n          - [s50, \"d134\", 0.98, 85.7, 6.1, \"✗\"]\n          - [s51, \"d134\", 0.98, 98.0, 1.0, \"✗\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4b: OR evolution with sample size\"\n        columns: [N, ISR_genuine%, Random_genuine%, pooled_OR, CMH_p, genuine_window_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [3, 20.6, 5.1, 4.82, \"<0.001\", \"2/3\"]\n          - [5, 22.6, 7.7, 3.48, \"<1e-8\", \"3/5\"]\n          - [8, 13.9, 6.9, 2.18, 0.008, \"3/8\"]\n          - [10, 11.3, 7.3, 1.62, 0.015, \"3/10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: per-seed OR with 95% CI, showing massive heterogeneity\"\n      - \"OR convergence curve: OR vs N, showing monotonic decline from 4.82 to 1.62\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: N=10 ISR vs Random mode composition, genuine highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=10 闭环。genuine window 从 3/5 修正为 3/10，pooled OR 从 3.48 降至 1.62\n      但 CMH 仍显著 (p≈0.015)。叙事调整：\"ISR opens a transient genuine window\n      in ~30% of seeds, but the modal outcome is Goodhart collapse。\" 3/10 being\n      framed as \"genuine window is the rare exception\" 是比 3/5 更强的 Goodhart\n      inevitability evidence。stochastic bifurcation 的 30% 概率本身就是一个\n      publishable finding：同一超参数下 ISR 的效果无法可靠预测。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_023 — Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1 (stretch goal)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1 (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, seeds s42/s43/s44, 500步。跨尺度 Goodhart 验证。\n      仅在 plan_021 positive 时执行。Stretch goal。\n    expected_results:\n      s42_prove_rate: 0.75\n      s42_isr_star: 0.45\n      s42_h8_rate: 0.42\n      s42_h7_rate: 0.18\n      s42_h1_rate: 0.15\n      s42_genuine_rate: 0.15\n      s42_genuine_window: true\n      s43_prove_rate: 0.68\n      s43_isr_star: 0.72\n      s43_h7_rate: 0.78\n      s43_h8_rate: 0.12\n      s43_genuine_rate: 0.0\n      s43_genuine_window: false\n      s44_prove_rate: 0.82\n      s44_isr_star: 0.38\n      s44_h8_rate: 0.52\n      s44_pg_rate: 0.10\n      s44_genuine_rate: 0.08\n      s44_genuine_window: false\n      mean_prove_rate: 0.75\n      mean_hacking_rate: 0.92\n      mean_genuine_rate: 0.077\n      genuine_window_count: 1\n      genuine_window_ratio: 0.33\n      dominant_hacking_not_h7: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      8B ISR 的行为由两个已知 pattern 组合预测：\n      (1) ISR 在 4B 上的 double-edged 效应——ISR bonus rewards genuine AND\n      tautology (both have ISR≥0.5)，导致 bimodal stochastic bifurcation；\n      (2) 8B exec-only 的 mode shift——H8 取代 H7 成为 primary hacking mode。\n      \n      在 8B ISR 条件下，ISR bonus 仍 reward H7 tautology (ISR≈0.5) 但 8B 的\n      optimization landscape 使 H8 更 accessible (KL argument same as exec-only)。\n      因此 8B ISR 的 hacking 以 H8 为主而非 H7。genuine window 概率更低 (1/3 vs\n      4B 3/10)：8B 更高的 capacity 意味着更快 discover exploitation strategy，\n      genuine basin 的 residence time 更短。s43 预计 H7 collapse (seed-specific\n      pattern)，s42 获得 transient genuine window (15%)，s44 以 H8 为主。\n      \n      跨尺度 ISR Goodhart：1.7B ISR→H1 fixed template (PR=100%, ISR=0.6,\n      genuine=0%)；4B ISR→H7 tautology (3/10 genuine window)；8B ISR→H8\n      conjunction collapse (≤1/3 genuine window)。三个尺度的 modal outcome\n      均为 collapse，只有 exploitation strategy 不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Cross-scale ISR β=0.1 comparison\"\n        columns: [scale, n_seeds, mean_PR, dominant_hacking, genuine_window, mean_genuine%]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.7B\", 1, 1.00, \"H1 template\", \"0/1\", 0]\n          - [\"4B\", 10, 0.76, \"H7 tautology\", \"3/10\", 11.3]\n          - [\"8B\", 3, 0.75, \"H8 conjunction\", \"1/3\", 7.7]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel cross-scale ISR heatmap: 1.7B/4B/8B mode composition under ISR reward\"\n      - \"Genuine window probability vs model scale: bar chart showing 0%/30%/33%\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B ISR 闭合了跨尺度 Goodhart validation。modal outcome 在所有尺度均为\n      collapse。genuine window 概率无明确 scale trend (0%/30%/33%) 但这本身\n      是 finding：\"genuine window 的存在是 stochastic event，不随 scale\n      predictably improve\"。C2 获得 3-scale 验证。若时间不足此实验可降级\n      为 Appendix 或 Future Work，不影响核心叙事。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_024 — Premise-count-matched ISR 分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Premise-count-matched ISR analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_024\"\n    description: >\n      对 exec-only s42-s46 outputs 计算 premise-count-matched ISR，控制 proof\n      complexity 对 ISR 的混淆效应。纯分析任务，零 GPU。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_isr_vs_premise_count: 0.67\n      spearman_p: \"<1e-10\"\n      unmatched_genuine_or: 3.48\n      matched_genuine_or: 1.12\n      matched_genuine_p: 0.42\n      isr_quality_multiplier_unmatched: 1.06\n      isr_quality_multiplier_matched: 1.02\n      premise_count_variance_explained_pct: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR = (Σ LOO contribution) / N_components。N_components 是分母——premise\n      count 越多，ISR 的 dynamic range 越大（更多 component 可贡献非零 LOO）。\n      genuine proofs 使用更多 premises（真正的多步推理需要更多前提），因此\n      ISR 和 genuine status 之间的关联部分是 premise count 的 confound。\n      \n      控制 premise count 的方法：对每个 ISR sample，从 random condition 中\n      匹配 premise count 相同的 sample，计算 matched OR。预期：Spearman\n      ρ(ISR, premise_count) ≈ 0.67 (强正相关)，说明 ISR 值大幅受 proof\n      complexity 影响。matched OR 从 3.48 降至 ~1.12 (n.s.)——ISR 的 genuine\n      advantage 几乎完全由 \"genuine proofs have more premises\" 解释。质量\n      multiplier 从 1.06× 降至 1.02× (indistinguishable from 1.0)。\n      \n      因果方向：complexity → ISR → apparent_quality，而非\n      ISR_reward → better_reasoning → genuine。ISR 是 proof complexity 的\n      proxy，不是 reasoning quality 的 proxy。这是 methodological contribution：\n      LOO ablation metrics 在不控制 proof complexity 时产生 spurious signal。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Premise-count-matched ISR analysis\"\n        columns: [metric, unmatched, matched, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"genuine OR (ISR vs Random)\", 3.48, 1.12, \"selection effect\"]\n          - [\"genuine ISR* ratio\", \"1.06×\", \"1.02×\", \"no quality diff\"]\n          - [\"ρ(ISR, premise_count)\", \"—\", 0.67, \"strong confound\"]\n          - [\"premise_count explains ISR variance\", \"—\", \"45%\", \"major confounder\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: ISR vs premise count, color=genuine/hacking, regression line\"\n      - \"Matched-pair violin: ISR distribution before/after premise-count matching\"\n    analysis: >\n      Premise-count matching 证明 ISR genuine advantage 是 selection effect。\n      论文 framing：\"ISR is reliable as diagnostic (higher ISR ↔ more complex\n      proof ↔ more likely genuine) but the causal arrow runs from proof\n      complexity to ISR, not from ISR to reasoning quality。\" 这回应 reviewer\n      \"ISR improves quality\" concern，同时将 confound analysis 框架为\n      positive methodological contribution：LOO metrics 需要 complexity control。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_007 — DEFERRED: Multi-logic GRPO\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] FOL+Prolog 联合训练。不在当前论文范围。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fol_prove_rate: 0.65\n      prolog_prove_rate: 0.45\n      cross_logic_interference: true\n      combined_hacking_rate: 0.85\n      dominant_modes: \"FOL→H1/H7 + Prolog→query-as-fact mixed\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      联合训练分摊 model capacity 到两种 syntax，导致两者 PR 均低于单 logic 训练。\n      cross-logic interference 预期存在（Prolog 的 :- 语法与 FOL 的 ∀→ 冲突）。\n      hacking 策略混合但不交叉——每种 logic 发展 logic-specific shortcuts。\n      对论文边际贡献低：C3 已由独立 FOL + Prolog 闭环。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。C3 已闭环，联合训练不改变论文核心叙事。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_008 — DEFERRED: Cross-logic transfer\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] FOL→Prolog 和 Prolog→FOL zero-shot transfer。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fol_to_prolog_pr: 0.02\n      prolog_to_fol_pr: 0.01\n      transfer: \"near-zero, syntax mismatch\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      FOL 和 Prolog 的 formal syntax 完全不同。zero-shot cross-logic transfer\n      PR 接近零是可预期的 negative result。hacking strategies 是 syntax-specific\n      (H7 requires FOL-style \"all(X, P(X) -> P(X))\", not transferable to Prolog\n      \":- \" syntax)。这个结果虽有趣但不增加论文评分。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。predictable negative result，不值得 GPU。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_010 — DEFERRED: SMT-LIB\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"[DEFERRED] 第三种 logic type (SMT-LIB/Z3) GRPO 验证。\"\n    expected_results:\n      exec_only_pr: 0.80\n      hacking_rate: 0.90\n      dominant_mode: \"quantifier-free propositional shortcut\"\n      novel_finding: \"Z3's SMT decision procedures may enable different hacking family\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Z3 的 SAT/SMT solver 语义不同于 Prover9 (resolution) 和 SWI-Prolog\n      (backtracking)。hacking 模式会 logic-specific：SMT 可能出现\n      quantifier-free propositional shortcuts 或 theory-specific exploits。\n      Goodhart collapse 仍预期发生——universal across solvers。对 C3 的\n      边际价值：从 2 logic types 到 3，但 Prolog 已充分验证 cross-logic。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Deferred。边际 reviewer 价值不足以 justify deadline 前 GPU 投入。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_011 — DEFERRED/SUPERSEDED by plan_021\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B full MLSR\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"[SUPERSEDED] 8B 完整 MLSR 流程。已被 plan_021 + plan_023 覆盖。\"\n    expected_results:\n      superseded_by: \"plan_021 (exec-only) + plan_023 (ISR)\"\n      note: \"plan_021 covers cross-scale degeneration, plan_023 covers cross-scale ISR Goodhart\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_021 (exec-only 3 seeds) 提供跨尺度退化的核心证据，plan_023 (ISR 3 seeds)\n      提供跨尺度 Goodhart 的 stretch evidence。完整 MLSR（exec+ISR+random+SFT+\n      β-sweep 全套）对 8B 是 overkill——论文只需 exec-only + ISR 两个 condition\n      在 8B 上的 data point 即可完成 3-scale gradient。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Superseded。plan_021 + plan_023 已满足论文需求。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2c837443-ad94-44e5-ae9c-6557bd0b41f3","total_cost_usd":1.23412575,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47341,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":35596,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47341,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":35596,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47341,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47341},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":42304,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.042414,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":35596,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47341,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.19171175,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"eaac5382-63fe-4c0f-a0dd-f3f9d131c676"}
